# BMONI Embedded — frontend environment
#
# Copy to `.env.local` and fill in to switch the backend from the in-browser
# sandbox ledger to Supabase. Leave both blank (or delete the file) to keep
# running on the Phase 1 local sandbox — the UI is identical either way.
#
# Project Settings → API in the Supabase dashboard has both values.
# SECURITY: only the anon key ever lives here. RLS scopes every row to the
# signed-in user. The service role key belongs to the Phase 2 FastAPI backend
# and must NEVER be added to this frontend.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
